  "correctValue": "34",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Using expansions, we get,<br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><munder><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></munder><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>!</mo></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>!</mo></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mfrac><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>!</mo></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>-</mo><mfrac><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>!</mo></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></math><br /><math><munder><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></munder><mfrac><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>+</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>6</mn></mrow></mfrac><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo></mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>!</mo></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></math><br /><math><mo>&#8757;</mo></math> in the denominator lowest power of <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></math> is <math><mn>3</mn></math><br />For the limit to be finite, the numerator should also have the least power of <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></math> as <math><mn>3</mn></math><br /><math><mo>&#8756;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#8201;</mo><mo>&#8201;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><math><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced></math><br />Now,&nbsp;<math><mfrac><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>6</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>18</mn></math><br />From&nbsp;<math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mi></mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mi></mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>, we get,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>18</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>18</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>&#8211;</mo><mn>36</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>&#8211;</mo><mn>18</mn></math><br /><math><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi></mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>18</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>8</mn><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>18</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>8</mn></mrow></mfrac></math></p>",
